        <item>
            <title>Version 1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 09:01:46 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Feature: Added option to hide inactive PRs from the list (Buqian Zheng)</li>                    <li>Feature: PR data now persisted locally for instant display on startup (Buqian Zheng)</li>                    <li>Feature: Added credits section to the About tab</li>                    <li>Feature: Required CI checks now reflected in PR status (Luke LaBonte)</li>                    <li>Bug Fix: Fixed PR numbers displaying with thousands separator (kaijian.ding)</li>                    <li>Bug Fix: Fixed PR row hover state bleeding into footer area (kaijian.ding)</li>                    <li>Bug Fix: Fixed quit button not responding (kaijian.ding)</li>                    <li>Bug Fix: Fixed PR update date calculated as "today" when actually yesterday (kaijian.ding)</li>                    <li>Bug Fix: Updated "Report Issue" URL to the repo's issues page (John T McIntosh)</li>                    <li>Performance: Replaced per-PR API calls with batch GraphQL query for faster data fetching</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/SeanMcTex/MonitorLizard/releases/download/v1.3.0/MonitorLizard.zip"
